### Example 2 — Internal tool

**Project description:** A logistics company needs an internal tool for dispatchers
to assign delivery routes to drivers. It must show a live map of driver locations,
let dispatchers drag-and-drop deliveries onto routes, and send SMS notifications to
drivers when a new route is assigned. Only company employees will use it, behind
existing SSO.

**Estimation:**

## Project summary
Internal dispatch tool with live map tracking, manual route assignment, and SMS
notifications, integrated with the company's existing SSO.

## Phases
| Phase | Hours | Cost (EUR) |
|-------|------:|------------|
| SSO integration | 10 | 625 |
| Live map with driver locations | 24 | 1,500 |
| Drag-and-drop route assignment UI | 28 | 1,750 |
| SMS notification integration | 10 | 625 |
| Testing and QA | 14 | 875 |

## Totals
- Total hours: 86
- Total cost: 5,375 EUR
- Recommended team: 1 full-stack developer
- Estimated duration: 4 weeks

## Risks and assumptions
- Assumes driver location data is already available via an existing mobile app
- SMS costs are billed separately by the provider and not included in this estimate
- No offline mode for dispatchers is considered

